# The REBOL 3 interpreter JEBOL's answers are checked against, built from the
# source in rebol3-source/ by `scripts/build-r3.sh`. A tool rather than source,
# and a 2.1M platform-specific binary at that. Its generated spec lands in
# build/r3/, which the Gradle line further down already covers.
#
# There is deliberately no entry for a downloaded `/r3` beside it. One sat here
# for a while, a 3.22.1 release, and a release is always older than the checkout
# next to it: four wrong readings were traced to asking it instead of this one.
# It was deleted, and leaving it un-ignored means that if anyone fetches one
# again `git status` will say so rather than hiding it.
/r3-head

# Gradle
/.gradle/
/build/

# Every gate run's test results and summary, one timestamped folder each,
# written by `archiveTestResults` at the end of `allTests`. Outside build/ so
# `clean` keeps them; local history, not source.
/test-history/

# The Allium CLI's one-time notice marker, when the cache directory is not
# writable and it falls back to the project root.
/.allium-cli-notice-shown

# jqwik's record of which property-test seeds failed, so it can try them
# first next time. Build output, and it was committed in the first commit and
# sat there. `build.gradle.kts` now points jqwik at build/ so it is not
# text here at all; this catches a run that predates that or bypasses it.
/.jqwik-database

# Editors and operating systems
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
*.iml
.vscode/
.claude/settings.local.json
